SCENE
ID=WELCOME_001
NAME=Welcome Runtime Colour Override Test
DESC=Boot welcome scene with assignment colour override
CATEGORY=NORMAL
CAPABILITIES=WELCOME_COMPATIBLE
COLORS
white=255,255,255
SCRIPT
MOVE BOTH POS 20 SPEED 60
WAIT TARGET
SET BOTH MAINLEDS COLOR white
SET BOTH LENS COLOR white
SHOW
WAIT 700ms
CLEAR BOTH MAINLEDS
CLEAR BOTH LENS
SHOW
MOVE BOTH POS 0 SPEED 60
WAIT TARGET
END
